<title>BELGIUM: TULLETT BELGIUM HEAD DIES IN ROAD ACCIDENT.</title>
<headline>TULLETT BELGIUM HEAD DIES IN ROAD ACCIDENT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patrick Annez de Taboada, managing director of brokerage Tullett &amp; Tokyo Forex Belgium SA, has died in a road accident, Tullett said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Annez de Taboada, who joined Tullett in 1984, crashed with his motor bike on Sunday.</p>
<p>At least seven people died in motor bike crashes at the weekend, as the unusually hot weather brought out biking enthusiasts in droves.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
